# Grill me with doc

Before building something unclear, ask about: business goal + target user, current pain vs expected
behavior, in/out of scope, acceptance criteria, UI/API/data needs, permissions/privacy/security,
edge cases and priority. Ask concise questions first — don't dump every possible question.

Output a brief in `docs/work/<issue-id-or-slug>/feature.md` using
[`docs/templates/feature-template.md`](/docs/templates/feature-template.md). Skip the doc for
trivial, low-risk changes. Full guidance: @.cursor/skills/grill-me-with-doc/SKILL.md
